  "description": "A bright and spacious top floor apartment, 32 The Sycamores is likely to appeal to a wide variety of purchasers, including first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is well laid out and comprises an entrance hall with large hot press, a generous living room with open fireplace, a separate kitchen, one large double bedroom and a bathroom. Of particular note, the apartment also benefits from a large attic providing excellent additional storage. Outside, there is a secure storage shed and parking is included.\r\n\r\nStradbrook Hill is a mature and beautifully landscaped development, enjoying generous open green spaces and a wonderfully peaceful setting. The location is exceptionally convenient, close to a wide range of amenities in Monkstown, Deansgrange, Blackrock and Dun Laoghaire. Nearby neighbourhood shops include Twomey’s SuperValu, FX Buckley Butchers and Grange Pharmacy, while local sports clubs such as Cuala GAA, Blackrock Rugby Club and Newtown Park Tennis Club are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe area is well served by public transport, with nearby bus services including the L25, L26 and S8, together with the DART at Dun Laoghaire and Blackrock. IADT and Dun Laoghaire College of Further Education are also located close by.\r\n\r\nInspection is highly recommended to those seeking a spacious apartment in this popular and highly convenient location.....\n\nEntrance Hall: Welcoming entrance hall with large hot press and access to floored attic storage via folding stairs.\n\nLiving Room: Bright and spacious reception room with picture window overlooking the front. Features include a marble open fireplace, built-in storage unit and press housing the gas-fired central heating unit. Door to\n\nKitchen: Fitted with a range of built-in floor and eye-level units with worktop over, tiled splashback, extractor hood and plumbing for washing machine.\n\nBedroom: Large double bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom: Bath with shower attachment over, pedestal wash hand basin and w/c.\n\nOutside: The development is set amid mature landscaped grounds with large open green spaces. Parking is included and there is also a secure external storage shed.\n\nParking: One space and ample communal parking.\n\nService Charge: €307.87 per quarter",
